1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,937
Plot them.

2
00:00:00,937 --> 00:00:06,054
Almost every element shows plus two, from losing the 4s pair.

3
00:00:06,054 --> 00:00:08,541
Scandium prefers plus three.

4
00:00:08,541 --> 00:00:21,158
The highest state climbs, plus four for titanium, plus five for vanadium, plus six for chromium, up to plus seven for manganese, which uses all five d and both s electrons.

